<h3>The Eggsecutioner Returns</h3>

<div>Spring is a busy time for Albion=E2=80=99s tireless <strong>vanity mer=
chants</strong>, and they=E2=80=99ll once again be selling their wares in r=
eturn for gold and Surprise Eggs. Among their products you can find:</div>

<ul>
	<li>The fearsome <strong>Eggsecutioner</strong> vanity weapon</li>
	<li>Stylish<strong> "Bunny Stalker"</strong> Armor, Hats, and Backpack</li=
>
	<li>Delicious<strong> Chocolate Bars</strong></li>
	<li>Alluring<strong> Fool=E2=80=99s Golden Eggs</strong></li>
	<li>And more=E2=80=A6</li>
</ul>

<div>With all this going on, Albion will be bustling with life as players h=
unt down treasures, trade seasonal goods in the cities, and take their new =
Spring Cottontails out for a ride. Check out the Rites of Spring Patchnotes=
 <a href=3D"https://albiononline.com/changelog/rites-of-spring"><strong>her=
e</strong></a>, and go join in the fun!</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
